│  Flight Costs:                                                                                  │
│  A round-trip flight from Vienna, Austria to Madrid, Spain costs approximately €250-€350        │
│  (depending on the airline and time of booking). This is a relatively affordable option         │
│  compared to Dubai, which can cost around €800-€1,200 or more for a similar duration.           │
│                                                                                                 │
│  Weather Forecast:                                                                              │
│  Madrid enjoys mild winters and warm springs. In February, the average high temperature is      │
│  around 12°C (54°F), while in March, it's around 17°C (63°F). These temperatures are ideal for  │
│  exploring the city's outdoor attractions like the Retiro Park or strolling along the Puerta    │
│  del Sol.                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                 │
│  Attractions:                                                                                   │
│  Madrid is a treasure trove of art, history, and culture. Some must-visit attractions include:  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  1. The Prado Museum: Home to an extensive collection of European art, including works by       │
│  Goya, Velázquez, and El Greco.                                                                 │
│  2. The Royal Palace of Madrid: A grand palace that serves as the official residence of the     │
│  Spanish royal family.                                                                          │
│  3. The Reina Sofia Museum: Features an impressive collection of modern and contemporary art,   │
│  including Picasso's Guernica.                                                                  │
│  4. The Plaza Mayor: A historic square surrounded by cafes, shops, and street performers.       │
│  5. Tapas bars: Experience traditional Spanish cuisine and soak up the lively atmosphere in     │
│  one of the many tapas bars throughout the city.                                                │
│                                                                                                 │
│  Additional Recommendations:                                                                    │
│  - Take a stroll through the Retiro Park, a beautiful green oasis in the heart of the city.     │
│  - Visit the Thyssen-Bornemisza National Museum, which complements the Prado and Reina Sofia    │
│  museums with an impressive collection of art from around the world.                            │
│  - Explore the historic neighborhood of La Latina, known for its narrow streets, charming       │
│  shops, and lively nightlife.                                                                   │
│                                                                                                 │
│  Madrid offers an unbeatable combination of culture, history, and entertainment, making it the  │
│  ideal destination for your trip. With its relatively affordable flight costs, pleasant         │
│  weather, and abundance of attractions, you'll have a memorable experience in this vibrant      │
│  city.                                                                                          │
